shots is an independent Chromium-first Go rewrite. It reproduces
shot-scraper's command names, flags, YAML formats, and authentication
state-file format for compatibility. It shares no source code with the
original Python implementation.

Compatibility reference: shot-scraper 1.11, commit
177f5abb32add7622d5152eb7064a2ce47dd2fbf.
